OL,3,GNEWSAGoose Fair parking fines doubled
OL,4,Alast year
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors to this year's Goose Fair in
OL,7,FNottingham are being urged to check
OL,8,Frestrictions before travelling after
OL,9,Ffigures revealed the number of parking
OL,10,Ffines doubled last year.
OL,12,FThe historic fair on the Forest
OL,13,FRecreation Ground began on Friday, and
OL,14,Fvisitors are not allowed to park on
OL,15,Fnearby residential streets.
OL,17,FA BBC freedom of information (FOI)
OL,18,Frequest to Nottingham City Council
OL,19,Frevealed nearly 900 fines were issued
OL,20,Fto drivers who flouted parking rules
OL,21,Fthere in 2025, compared to about 450 in
OL,22,Feach of the three previous years.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
