OL,3,GNEWSAGoose Fair parking fines doubled
OL,4,Alast year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said the rise in fines
OL,7,Fwas because it had trained more staff
OL,8,Fto enforce parking restrictions during
OL,9,Fthe event.
